---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Accessibility approach and feedback path for The OC Events Market website."
>
  <article class="prose-page">
    <h1>Accessibility</h1>
    <p>
      The OC Events Market aims to provide a clear, usable website across devices and input methods.
      The experience includes keyboard navigation, visible focus, meaningful headings, descriptive
      links, motion preferences, responsive reflow, and considered text contrast.
    </p>

    <h2>Using this website</h2>
    <p>
      The primary navigation, disclosure content, and links are intended to work with a keyboard and
      common assistive technology. Images include text alternatives when they convey content.
      Decorative imagery uses empty alternatives.
    </p>

    <h2>Need help or found a barrier?</h2>
    <p>
      Use the <a href="/contact/">text contact option</a> to tell us what page you were using and what
      got in the way. We will use that detail to review the experience and respond.
    </p>

    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <p>
      When reporting an issue, include the page, device or browser, and the task you were trying to
      complete. Do not include sensitive personal information.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
